# Cmd+Left and Cmd+Right in iTerm2's Natural Text Editing send Ctrl+A and Ctrl+E, which move the caret to the start and end of the text.
file <<END
- Buy milk
END
see Buy milk
keys <Enter> <C-a>
type Go
keys <Space>
keys <C-e>
type  now
keys <Esc>
see - Go Buy milk now
quit
saved <<END
- Go Buy milk now
END
